# Simba AI Design System

Product name: **Simba AI** (never "GrowthOS" in user-facing UI). Friendly, confident, modern — an AI marketing team that feels alive but professional. Rounded, warm, generous whitespace.

## Token architecture (three layers — never skip a layer)

Primitive (raw values) → Semantic (`--sem-*`) → Component (shadcn / usage).
Components NEVER use raw hex or Tailwind default palette colors (`bg-blue-600`, `#00A99D` inline). Only semantic/component tokens.

## Primitive colors (Madyen + functional)

`--teal` `#00A99D`, `--teal-dark` `#0F6F68`, `--gold` `#E3B341`, `--orange` `#FCC44B`, `--orange-light` `#FBE7BB`, `--cream` `#FCF1D7`, `--turquoise-light` `#CCEEE6`, `--crimson-pastel` `#FE8B9F`, `--red-light` `#FDDADE`, `--green` `#60BE67`, `--red-error` `#C43D4B`, `--ink` `#1A2422`, `--ink-soft` `#5A6E6B`, `--surface` `#FFFFFF`, `--surface-soft` `#F7FAF9`.

## Semantic mapping

- `--sem-primary` / hover → teal-dark (buttons, links, interactive text)
- `--sem-accent` → teal (logo, focus rings, charts, large display text)
- `--sem-accent-soft` → turquoise-light (selected / active tab / info)
- success / warning / danger + soft surfaces; `--sem-highlight` → cream (AI content)

## Accessibility (non-negotiable)

Teal `#00A99D` fails WCAG AA for normal white text. Primary buttons/links = teal-dark + white. Never white body text on `#00A99D`; never `#00A99D` body text on white.

## Typography

Headings: Poppins 600/700 (`font-heading`). Body/UI: Inter (`font-sans`). Metrics: tabular-nums. Scale 12 / 13 / 14 / 16 / 18 / 22 / 28 / 36. Line-height 1.5 body, 1.2 headings.

## Shape & depth

Radius: 12px cards, 8px inputs/buttons, 999px pills. Shadows: subtle two-layer (`shadow-elevated`). Borders: 1px `--sem-border`. Spacing: 4px grid.

## Component rules

- Button primary: teal-dark bg, white text, hover darkens, radius 8
- Button secondary/outline: white, border, ink; ghost tertiary; destructive red-error + white
- Active nav: accent-soft pill + teal-dark text + 3px teal left indicator
- Status badges: success / warning / danger / neutral / ai variants
- Tables: no vertical rules, 1px row dividers, ~44px rows, 12px uppercase header ink-soft
- Charts: teal, gold, crimson-pastel, green, teal-dark; grid `--grid-line`
- AI content: cream or accent-soft + `✦ Simba` badge
- Focus: 2px teal ring, 2px offset
- Dark mode: out of scope — do not add

## Product naming

User-facing strings → **Simba AI**. Keep code identifiers, DB names, package names, and migration comments as-is unless renaming is explicitly requested.
